Subject: [PATCH 271/297] Meridian: back up and restore spaces
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

A space's name, colour, icon, grain, pinned tabs and folders as a JSON file
in Downloads, from its menu (Back Up Space…), every space from Settings >
Advanced (Back Up); Restore from Settings or the sidebar's menu adds each
as a new space without opening its tabs. No cookies, passwords or history.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
